<title>USA: Jaffe resigns as Bell Indus president, COO.</title>
<headline>Jaffe resigns as Bell Indus president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bell Industries Inc said Bruce Jaffe has resigned as president and chief operating officer due to &quot;policy differences.&quot; The company said Gordon Graham was named to succeed him.</p>
<p>Graham has been serving as senior vice president of Bell since 1988 and was elected a director of the Company in 1994.</p>
